1
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:44,730
Ah!

2
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,360
Mister.

3
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,420
What are you doing?

4
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:55,260
Isn't this what you asked for?

5
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,830
What,

6
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:57,860
forgot?

7
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:02,760
I...

8
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,060
I...

9
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:11,330
Close your eyes.

10
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:25,560
Wait.

11
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:26,400
Mister,

12
00:01:26,630 --> 00:01:27,030
do you

13
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:29,000
really like me?

14
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:34,759
Girl...

15
00:01:35,729 --> 00:01:36,530
I...

16
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:40,800
The Demonic Cult!

17
00:01:43,530 --> 00:01:45,190
The Demonic Cult is invading!

18
00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:48,700
Seeking death.

19
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:49,560
Attack!

20
00:02:00,560 --> 00:02:01,530
Protect A-Kong!

21
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,230
Mister,

22
00:02:07,500 --> 00:02:08,759
you haven't recovered yet.

23
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,800
Let me go.

24
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:14,060
Commander Ye,

25
00:02:14,260 --> 00:02:15,460
stay and protect him.

26
00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:19,500
Okay.

27
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,930
But you have to use this.

28
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,400
It seems Longyuan likes its new master.

29
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:38,200
Go.

30
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,200
Who is that?

31
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:52,130
So powerful.

32
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:53,230
It's Madam.

33
00:03:02,730 --> 00:03:04,060
What a powerful sword.

34
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:07,160
It can actually merge
with my spiritual power.

35
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:10,960
Little one,

36
00:03:11,200 --> 00:03:11,930
not bad.

37
00:03:13,830 --> 00:03:14,630
Bai Ze,

38
00:03:14,900 --> 00:03:16,000
why are you here?

39
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:18,060
To protect you, of course.

40
00:03:18,230 --> 00:03:19,800
How affectionate.

41
00:03:20,230 --> 00:03:23,000
But I advise Mr. Bai to marry her quickly,

42
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:25,160
before she climbs into someone else's bed

43
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,200
and you regret it.

44
00:03:30,430 --> 00:03:31,900
With the enemy right in front of us,

45
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:34,030
Miss Feng still has the mood to joke.

46
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,600
Little one, wait for me.

47
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,500
I'll help you.

48
00:03:44,329 --> 00:03:46,460
Longyuan only recognizes one master.

49
00:03:46,860 --> 00:03:48,120
It chooses for itself.

50
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,530
Even Longyuan recognizes her.

51
00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:07,400
Then what am I?

52
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:09,760
I've waited a thousand years,

53
00:04:10,060 --> 00:04:12,790
and even a sword understands him
better than I do.

54
00:04:14,600 --> 00:04:16,329
I will take good care of Qingwu.

55
00:04:20,029 --> 00:04:23,000
You said you would take care of me.

56
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,260
Is this how you take care of me?

57
00:04:26,130 --> 00:04:27,400
Now you only have eyes

58
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:29,930
for that girl of unknown origin.

59
00:04:41,300 --> 00:04:42,000
Bai Ze!

60
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,200
You...

61
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:49,300
Woman,

62
00:04:49,530 --> 00:04:51,530
can't you even tell friend from foe?

63
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,900
If that's the case,

64
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:56,830
don't stay on the battlefield
and cause trouble.

65
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:02,830
How are you?

66
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:04,100
Are you badly hurt?

67
00:05:09,130 --> 00:05:10,230
Little one.

68
00:05:10,600 --> 00:05:11,330
I'm fine.

69
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,060
Girl,

70
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,460
are you hurt?

71
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,630
Mister, I'm fine.

72
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,090
That's good.

73
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:22,360
The enemies are mostly dealt with.

74
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,400
Come back with me.

75
00:05:24,530 --> 00:05:25,330
But

76
00:05:25,630 --> 00:05:26,890
what just happened...

77
00:05:27,930 --> 00:05:29,790
Sect Leader Yan saw it all, right?

78
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:35,020
If you can't even manage
your own subordinates,

79
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:37,130
then don't take her away.

80
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:38,900
Ah!

81
00:05:39,330 --> 00:05:41,100
Mr. Bai, I will never forget

82
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,960
you saving my life today.

83
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:44,200
As for the girl...

84
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:45,300
Ah!

85
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:49,260
what happens between us
has nothing to do with Mr. Bai.
